s about the appropriate path.\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; When I then try\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; &gt; install_github(&#39;ggobi/qtbase&#39;)\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; I get the following error:\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; dyld: Library not loaded: /opt/local/lib/libz.1.dylib\r<br>&gt;   Referenced from: /Users/neuwirth/Qt5.4.0/5.4/clang_64/lib/QtCore.framework/Versions/5/QtCore\r<br>&gt;   Reason: image not found\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; I do not understand what is going on here since I libz.1.dylib exists on LD_LIBRARY_PATH and LIBRARY_PATH\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; Any hints to solve this problem?\r<br>&gt; \r<br>"
