     "Nice. The last time I tried it on Mac OS X, I was using Homebrew\r<br>(<a href=\"http://cranvas.org/download.html#install-qt-under-mac-os-x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cranvas.org/download.html%23install-qt-under-mac-os-x&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246423886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0F2KhLklPkb8yW144s42fJ\">http://cranvas.org/download.html#install-qt-under-mac-os-x</a>), which I\r<br>believe is much much easier to manage software packages for developers\r<br>than manually downloading and configuring them. Anyway, if the\r<br>traditional way works for you, you may just use it.\r<br>\r<br>Regards,\r<br>Yihui\r<br>--\r<br>Yihui Xie &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">xiey...@gmail.com</a>&gt;\r<br>Web: <a href=\"http://yihui.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://yihui.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246423886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3rjR704ILRoWUBQBVXN5AW\">http://yihui.name</a>\r<br>"
    ],
